# ::tok Recently, the U.S. "chip war" against China has escalated significantly - first, the Netherlands and Japan agreed to start controls on the export of semiconductor manufacturing equipment to China under U.S. pressure; later, foreign media reported that the U.S. government is considering cutting off all ties between U.S. suppliers and Huawei and banning U.S. suppliers from supplying Huawei with any products; the Biden administration is also preparing to issue an executive order restricting U.S. investment in sensitive Chinese technology industries...
