# ::tok The Tourism Bureau organized a large-scale Hong Kong delegation of more than 100 people from the tourism department of the Hong Kong Government, the tourism industry and the media to Macau. In addition to working meetings and industry talks, representatives of the Hong Kong travel agency industry and the media visited a number of tourist attractions, hotels and tourism-related facilities in Macau in batches to introduce the latest Macau tourism products to the Hong Kong market and promote cultural and tourism linkages between the two places to expand the Hong Kong and Macao "online travel" market.
